---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | Organizing Small"
  description="Our affiliate disclosure and partnerships policy."
  robots="noindex, follow"
>
  <article style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 0;">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--color-text-light); font-size: 0.95rem;">
      Last updated: February 20, 2024
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">What is an Affiliate Link?</h2>
    <p>
      Some of the links on our website are affiliate links, which means we may earn a small commission if you make a purchase through these links. This does not cost you any additional money. We only recommend products and services that we genuinely believe will help you with home organization.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Which Links Are Affiliate Links?</h2>
    <p>
      Affiliate links may appear in:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Product recommendations within articles</li>
      <li>Links to organizing products on Amazon or other retailers</li>
      <li>Partnership promotions</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We will always clearly disclose when we have an affiliate relationship with a product or service.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Our Commitment</h2>
    <p>
      We are committed to providing honest, unbiased recommendations. We never recommend products simply because we earn a commission. Our primary goal is to help you organize your home successfully.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Financial Relationships</h2>
    <p>
      We may have affiliate relationships with:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Amazon Associates Program</li>
      <li>Other retailer affiliate programs</li>
      <li>Brand partnerships for product reviews</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Earnings Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      The earnings from affiliate links help support our website and allow us to continue creating free content. We are transparent about our relationships and never let financial incentives influence the quality of our advice.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">Questions?</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about our affiliate relationships or disclosure practices, please contact us at hello@organizingsmall.com or visit our <a href="/about/">About page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 2rem;">FTC Compliance</h2>
    <p>
      This disclosure complies with the Federal Trade Commission's (FTC) guidelines regarding endorsements and testimonials. We are committed to providing clear and conspicuous disclosures about our business relationships.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
